{
  "bookId": "archive-christmas2021",
  "id": "section-25820",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "25820001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "各位，久等了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "真恋",
          "text": "欸……大家都在了吗……抱歉来晚了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嘿嘿，我们的节日信使到了呢！不知道今天会收到什么礼物~\n优纪可是认真写了一整天的心愿单！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "或许是因为看了那种连篇累牍的东西，信使小姐才会迟到吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "什么嘛，花迦真过分……\n明明自己的心愿就写了粮丸的尾巴那么长！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820006",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "竟……竟然偷看……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "好了，让我来看看清单——\n第一位收件人，优纪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820008",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "欸？我吗我吗！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "优纪的礼物，是一份「超大节日惊喜」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "是我的第十二个心愿！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820011",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "难道说，这个似曾相识的气息是……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "请稍等，礼物就在门外。\n失陪一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "好期待呀……会是什么呢……是信使小姐能搬动的东西吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "可是她刚刚说了「超大」，对我们来说，超大的话只有……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "什、什么嘛……哪有的事，今、今天可是「手办之夜」！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "好了|101|，你的出场时间到了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "25820017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "凛",
          "text": "进去看看吧，她们等你很久了。\n……还有，节日快乐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
